WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.255 line:91%
Chapter 10. Results. Everything after class is in the tabs of Results.

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:14.957 line:91%
Open "Results". Every test of this class is saved here. The tabs at the top open the other pages of after class.

00:00:15.419 --> 00:00:20.456 line:91%
Tap a test to open it. Here, the Test 1 we did before the lesson.

00:00:20.908 --> 00:00:27.056 line:91%
At the top: the class average, how many students took part, and the questions to teach first.

00:00:27.518 --> 00:00:33.397 line:91%
The table shows every answer of every student. Green is right, and red is wrong.

00:00:33.850 --> 00:00:44.077 line:91%
The "Questions" tab shows the most common wrong answers. The "Skills" tab shows the score for each skill. Press "Export to Excel" to keep the marks.

00:00:44.532 --> 00:00:50.375 line:91%
After Test 2, compare the two tests: the progress of each student and of each skill.

00:00:52.832 --> 00:01:04.536 line:91%
Now the "Bonus points" tab. Students earn points at the end of every Test 2: 3, 2 and 1 for the podium, and one more for each student who did better than in Test 1.

00:01:04.988 --> 00:01:11.516 line:91%
Good behaviour notes add one point, and bad notes take one away. Type a number to change it.

00:01:11.971 --> 00:01:20.736 line:91%
The "Skill map" tab shows what the class knows, skill by skill, from every test and game this year. Recent results count more.

00:01:21.187 --> 00:01:33.056 line:91%
Green is 80% or more, yellow is 50 to 79%, and red is under 50%. The weakest skills come first, with the names of the students who need help.

00:01:33.516 --> 00:01:38.997 line:91%
Tap a name, or choose "See one student", to see all the skills of that student.

00:01:39.458 --> 00:01:50.817 line:91%
Each phone also practises its own red and yellow skills, with the brain button. Skills come back after 1, 3, 7 and 14 days, until they are green.

00:01:51.275 --> 00:02:01.016 line:91%
The "Record book" tab. Each time you use the app with a class, the lesson is written here by itself: the date, the hour, what you did, and the scores.

00:02:01.474 --> 00:02:08.877 line:91%
Press "Edit" to add the objectives, the homework or your reflection. A day without the app? Press "Add a lesson".

00:02:09.329 --> 00:02:18.598 line:91%
The "Marks" tab: add your own tests out of 20, like your "contrôles". The averages of each semester are ready to copy into Massar.

00:02:19.055 --> 00:02:29.676 line:91%
Press "Print" for a clean book to show the inspector, or "Excel" to keep the marks in a file. Chapters 11 and 13 show the Writing and Parents tabs.
